---
import {catalog} from '../../utils/content';
import OriginalWorkCard from './OriginalWorkCard.astro';
import OriginalPagination from './OriginalPagination.astro';
const featured=catalog.works.filter(w=>w.featured);
const categories=[...new Set(catalog.works.map(w=>w.category))];
---
<section class="works-library"><header class="works-library__hero"><div><p class="public-eyebrow">PORTFOLIO · SELECTED WORKS</p><h1 class="public-display">精选作品</h1></div><p>从软件、工具、实验与创作中，挑选值得展开讲述的作品。</p></header><section class="works-featured" aria-label="精选作品"><div class="works-featured__list">{featured.map((work,index)=><OriginalWorkCard work={work} prominent reverse={index%2===1}/>)}</div></section><section class="works-archive" aria-labelledby="works-archive-title" data-filter-scope data-static-pagination data-pagination-size="12" data-pagination-unit="件"><header class="works-archive__heading"><div><p class="public-eyebrow">EXPLORE THE ARCHIVE</p><h2 id="works-archive-title">全部作品</h2></div><p>按分类、形态和标签，找到感兴趣的作品。</p></header><section class="public-filters" aria-label="作品筛选"><div class="public-filters__tabs"><div class="public-filter-tabs" aria-label="作品分类"><button type="button" data-filter="全部" aria-pressed="true">全部作品</button>{categories.map(c=><button type="button" data-filter={c} aria-pressed="false">{c}</button>)}</div></div><div class="public-filters__row"><div class="public-search"><span class="public-search__label">搜索作品</span><div class="public-search__field"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="8.5" cy="8.5" r="5.5"/><path d="m13 13 4 4"/></svg><input type="search" data-filter-query aria-label="搜索作品" placeholder="搜索作品标题或技术栈"/></div></div><div class="public-filters__summary"><span data-filter-status>{catalog.works.length} 件作品</span></div></div></section><div class="works-archive__results"><div class="works-grid">{catalog.works.map(work=><div data-filter-item data-category={work.category}><OriginalWorkCard work={work}/></div>)}</div><p class="works-state" data-filter-empty hidden>暂无符合条件的公开作品。</p></div><OriginalPagination total={catalog.works.length} unit="件"/></section></section>
